This Flatpak also holds libsensors, the library of lm-sensors
(LGPL-2.1-or-later), built without changes from the lm-sensors tag
@LMS_TAG@, commit @LMS_COMMIT@. Its complete source is in the same
archive, in the directory lm-sensors-@LMS_TAG@, and at
https://github.com/lm-sensors/lm-sensors. The programs load it as a
shared library, /app/lib/libsensors.so.5, which a user can replace.
